        "text_pP4cQg": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h1><strong>Brewing Warmth for Your Everyday Moments</strong></h1><h3><strong>First Flavour, First Choice</strong></h3><p>We believe the day truly begins with the perfect cup. In Indian homes, tea and coffee are more than beverages\u2014they are comforting rituals that bring people together, spark conversations, and create moments of calm.</p><p>FIRST FLAVOUR was created to honor these everyday rituals with carefully crafted blends that feel like home. Our range brings together authentic taste, quality ingredients, and everyday comfort\u2014because premium quality should be enjoyed every day.</p><p>From the rich warmth of masala chai to refreshing iced tea and the bold aroma of instant coffee, our blends are made to suit every mood and moment.</p><p>We carefully source and prepare our products to deliver consistent taste, honest value, and wholesome goodness in every cup. Whether it\u2019s a quiet personal break, a morning pick-me-up, or a thoughtful gift for someone special, First Flavour is here to make everyday moments a little warmer.</p>",
