            "review_1_description": "The jasmine aroma is delicate and inviting, and the tea has a smooth floral taste without becoming overpowering. The leaves feel high quality, and it makes a beautifully calming afternoon cup.",
            "review_1_rating": 5,
            "review_2_image": "shopify://shop_images/review-2.webp",
            "review_2_heading": "Daniel K.",
            "review_2_description": "A wonderfully balanced black tea with a rich, malty body and a clean finish. It has a warm aroma and enough depth to enjoy plain, but it also holds up well with a splash of milk.",
            "review_2_rating": 4,
            "review_3_image": "shopify://shop_images/review-3.webp",
            "review_3_heading": "Priya S.",
            "review_3_description": "This blend tastes fresh and naturally bright, with a gentle citrus aroma that lifts every sip. The quality is noticeable in the whole leaves and smooth finish\u2014refreshing served hot or over ice.",
            "review_3_rating": 5,
            "review_4_image": "shopify://shop_images/review-4.webp",
            "review_4_heading": "Lucas T.",
            "review_4_description": "The roasted notes are pleasantly deep without any bitterness, and the aroma is wonderfully comforting. It feels carefully crafted and makes a satisfying, full-flavoured cup in the evening.",
            "review_4_rating": 4,
            "review_5_image": "shopify://shop_images/review-5.webp",
            "review_5_heading": "Sofia M.",
            "review_5_description": "A lovely tea with a soft honeyed taste and a subtle herbal aroma. It is smooth, fragrant, and never harsh, making it an easy everyday favourite when I want something comforting.",
            "review_5_rating": 5,
            "review_6_image": "shopify://shop_images/review-6.webp",
            "review_6_heading": "Ethan W.",
            "review_6_description": "Beautifully made and full of flavour, with a clean aroma and a silky mouthfeel. The tea tastes fresh from the first steep and remains enjoyable through multiple infusions.",
            "review_6_rating": 4
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
